sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Borrower
    participant R as Collateral route
    participant P as Aave
    participant M as Exit market
    U->>R: Repay with frozen aWETH collateral
    R->>P: Flash-borrow USDC, repay the debt
    R->>M: Sell the aWETH into USDC bids
    M->>R: USDC proceeds
    R->>P: Return the flash loan
    R->>U: Surplus and unsold collateral
